      "message": "We can\u0027t support different inputs/outputs for different arch. Because the end-goal is to create a single `cc_genrule`. And that `cc_genrule` would have all of the inputs/output for different architectures but arch-specific args/response_file_contents.\n\nThe same goes for the script. We\u0027re doing all of this to remove multiple `genrules` for a single action.",
